---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Star from '../components/Star.astro';

const github = 'https://github.com/noaRoblesLevy';
const email = 'hello@fractalnorth.com'; // placeholder, update when ready
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="What Fractal North is and what it researches."
  ogRoute="about"
>
  <article class="container about">
    <header class="about-head">
      <Star size={56} class="about-star" />
      <p class="eyebrow">Quantitative Research</p>
      <h1>About Fractal North</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose about-prose">
      <p class="lede">
        Fractal North is a research notebook on quantitative finance: an open
        record of what I am learning, building, and getting wrong.
      </p>

      <h2>What I research</h2>
      <p>
        The through-line is the distance between a model and a market. I write
        about market microstructure, the honest evaluation of trading
        strategies, and the statistics of backtesting, where selection bias and
        regime change quietly undo results that looked airtight on paper.
      </p>
      <p>
        On the building side, I work on low-latency market-data infrastructure
        and simulation: a C++ limit order book reconstruction and an
        inventory-aware market-making simulator. The code exists to pressure-test
        the ideas, not the other way around.
      </p>

      <h2>What this is not</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing here is investment advice or a signal service. It is research and
        education: methods, derivations, and post-mortems meant to be read,
        questioned, and reproduced.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        The best way to reach me is by email, or through the code on GitHub.
      </p>
      <ul class="contact-list">
        <li>
          <span class="contact-label">Email</span>
          <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="contact-label">GitHub</span>
          <a href={github} target="_blank" rel="me noopener">github.com/noaRoblesLevy</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="contact-label">CV</span>
          <a href="/cv.pdf">Download CV (placeholder)</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 1.5rem + 4vw, 4.5rem);
  }
  .about-head {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .about-star {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .about-head h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }
  .contact-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .contact-list li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .contact-label {
    flex: none;
    width: 4.5rem;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }
</style>
